          abs: `${L} counts the red part as plus: the gold part is ${fr(gold)} and the red part ${fr(red)}, and ${L} adds them to ${fr(o.v)}. Area under the axis counts as minus, so the integral is ${fr(gold)} − ${fr(red)} = ${fr(V)}.`,
